goal represents the whole specification, while `ta"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"sks.md` remains the authoritative record for individual work items."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"SpecFlow provides:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- five portable skills: `constitution`, `specify`, `plan-spec`, `tasks`, and `implement`;
