sDir` may be workspace-relative or absolute. `autoInjectContext` controls only the model-facing"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" progress snapshot; it does not change goal or artifact behavior."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Design constraints"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- Exports are named only; no default export is mixed into the Loader module.
